# Files that domain substitution leaves out, one per line, as paths in
# ungoogled-chromium's domain_substitution.list. Only files that name the
# Chrome Web Store's addresses, the XML namespace of its update responses, or
# the address of Google's update service belong here, for the services
# chromium-engine's "Google services Clair turns back on" allows
# (arc-extension-experience, D1; restore-certificate-revocation, D2).
# Substituted, the real store isn't the store: it gets no install API, and no
# update response parses. The component updater's address file names only the
# update service, which checks the certificate revocation list.
components/component_updater/component_updater_url_constants.cc
extensions/browser/updater/safe_manifest_parser.cc
extensions/common/api/_api_features.json
extensions/common/extension_urls.cc
